Central to this initiative is the introduction of a monthly "Open Forum Night," where citizens can voice concerns and provide feedback directly to council members. In addition, the city has launched an innovative app that allows for real-time updates on council decisions, policy changes, and community events. This app aims to keep residents informed and engaged, making local governance more accessible than ever.

