Back in the office, I relied heavily on our IT support team. We had some technical hiccups that could have derailed the entire afternoon, but the way they swooped in to save the day was nothing short of heroic. It reminded me that behind every seamless operation lies a team of dedicated professionals ready to tackle challenges head-on.

